"""XAL6030-102MEB - 1.0 uH 20 % shielded power inductor, Coilcraft XAL6030 (6.5 x 6.3 mm). Bare part.

Datasheet: Coilcraft XAL60xx series (the URL in pcb.toml).

TODO: the Coilcraft datasheet could not be retrieved while writing this package. The values
below are the LCSC listing of C2938919 (the JLCPCB part): 1 uH +-20 %, 23 A, 5.62 mOhm,
AEC-Q200, 6.5 x 6.3 mm. The listing does not say whether 23 A is the saturation or the
heating current; confirm Isat (and its inductance-drop definition), Irms and DCR max against
the Coilcraft table before a check relies on them.
"""

load("@stdlib/units.zen", "Current", "Inductance", "Resistance")
load("@stdlib/utils.zen", "format_value")

P1 = io(Net)
P2 = io(Net)

# LCSC C2938919 listing (see TODO above).
inductance = Inductance("1uH 20%")
current = Current("23A")
dcr = Resistance("5.62mOhm")

Component(
    name="XAL6030-102",
    prefix="L",
    symbol=Symbol(library="XAL6030-102.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("XAL6030.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="XAL6030-102MEB", manufacturer="Coilcraft"),
    pins={"1": P1, "2": P2},
    properties={
        "value": format_value(inductance, current),
        "inductance": inductance,
        "current": current,
        "dcr": dcr,
    },
    type="inductor",
)
